{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_037_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:940b73a7b791c6d527bc12619361fa46eb5caf05b4b2d0701dedcd2142f81e78",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f1c449d0839bd4a179d454a14560dee5518f463539e75d50e7225ee686000d5",
      "text": "辛苦啦。\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc6dc4dc75980ca674176dbcf3adb93b54fd94c39252e8ac679dead442fa5b64",
      "text": "今天不是白色情人节嘛。\n给，这个。是我送的回礼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a912e4bd8cadfc2a13012828525ef4784fef39b978b49f932e0089d94adc87",
      "text": "要是能配得上你送的巧克力就好啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dc28c2d37df21ccfb104536206340fd3d86efbeb8293844212d62e60bdfce16",
      "text": "大叔我以自己的方式，努力挑了感觉\n你会喜欢的礼物呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8272e57012ecfc31eda60da4a3003c8dd2ad870fd96ea9fa855c388d50ae6067",
      "text": "嘛，看你那副样子好像挺高兴的呢。\n呼——太好啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48f8f30a947d1ab89de6b7704044d86ecd65b8a24db4b20d90ab654da8805a8b",
      "text": "今天的工作也结束了呢——。\n●●●●プロデューサー酱也辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ad79bf907ef18b2abb1b411fd1cf0b4c18e3e2e03a03692d0b5fdee1d75627c",
      "text": "……呼，好。\n我也差不多该下定决心了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a81e00d29137357b89d5a529009c5c44f58f09bc5b8e1e895e9fd4894a044e4b",
      "text": "来，请收下。\n这是白色情人节的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000036:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec61e9d5c5e738e5e6792270c470d136586cbe26fd251ff92b55e8509b6b4b6d",
      "text": "好开心！原来特意为我准备了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000037:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10b247a1fb212481e3aa335f5683721fc5c9f53c393354a988db953e3a29c89a",
      "text": "哈啊～。光是送个礼物都这么紧张啊。\n不过看到你挺开心的，我也就放心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a660cfead29485ad3c4b64fd5af9f10156125c70a4d6268fad107e7e864f6219",
      "text": "哎呀——其实送什么能让你高兴，\n我还真是相当烦恼了一阵呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58906dc8be008b3416da9bb4dd5f8caec19cbd630ea9da96d9aa93b7d6e0a5a0",
      "text": "在专柜前翻来覆去走了好多次，\n提心吊胆生怕被当成可疑分子呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc6ec20432aeaf60e6ac5968b972cdc1b8b85458363ef9a76ece334868e92c7d",
      "text": "不过，一边想着●●●●プロデューサー酱的事\n一边左思右想的时间，也挺开心的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_037_22:5_02_037_22_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03378a8799b3532384e152bde6d4bdf2d41037e757eb3786471336ed12009cbe",
      "text": "嘛，今后也请多指教啦。\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
